      'In Animate → Clips, tap an asset track or choose a Placed asset, then open Options → Timing. Start and End are inclusive shot frame numbers; Hold is how many frames the instance stays on screen. Enter or leaving a number field commits one Undo step; Escape discards that field. Changing Start moves the interval while keeping its source phase; Hold and End set a fixed ending. Follow shot end restores automatic ending, which can shorten an automatically sized shot. Animated sources keep playing within the interval. Other tracks and source drawings are not retimed. Fixed shot durations limit the fields.',
